Subject: [PATCH] 3732: the walk waits for a search that found the person, and
 takes the phone id of the person the run found

Box 52781 (0 of 2 on 0147): find_warm_path now ran with no web search, but
answered no_target. tool_call_log of conv 49734: the walk was forced right
after search_contact_by_name, which found nobody (the target is not in the
owner's book), so the model passed the NAME as target_phone; the
second-degree search that found her came after.

- The walk is forced only after a round whose search returned at least one
  person.
- The run keeps who its own searches returned (phone id and name); a name
  passed to find_warm_path that is exactly one of those people becomes that
  person's phone id. Nobody the run was not shown, and no name two people
  share, is ever resolved.

